From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerard Marull-Paretas <gerard@teslabs.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:42:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: cpus: Add Cortex-M7

The Cortex-M7 is an Armv7E-M core, as the Cortex-M4, which the binding
lists. Add it with the other Cortex-M cores.

PebbleOS describes the Cortex-M7 of the STM32H747 with it.
---
 arm/cpus.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arm/cpus.yaml b/arm/cpus.yaml
index 8b5ab0d..22a1229 100644
--- a/arm/cpus.yaml
+++ b/arm/cpus.yaml
@@ -166,6 +166,7 @@ properties:
           - arm,cortex-m1
           - arm,cortex-m3
           - arm,cortex-m4
+          - arm,cortex-m7
           - arm,cortex-m33
           - arm,cortex-r4
           - arm,cortex-r5
